# Real HR/payroll data and one-off scratch dumps made from it while
# developing the importer — never belongs in version control (JSHSHIR,
# passport, phone, salary figures for real employees). Both modern and
# legacy Excel formats are supported now, so both are excluded.
/*.xlsx
/*.xls
~$*.xlsx
full_dump.txt
template_dump*.txt
template_indexed.txt

# Internal business/cost documentation — kept local, not on GitHub.
/*.docx
